#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:9
#: fac171d5f1ac4a989c60724d42b87b37
msgid "`Volz servos <https://www.volz-servos.com/English/Products/>`__ are high-end servos which can be controlled with a normal PWM signal or using a custom RS-422 serial protocol.  This page describes the setup when using the serial protocol"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:13
#: 9d874a1fc6314a3a9bc19e39eb826697
msgid "This wiki page is a work-in-progress and has not been verified to be correct. Support for this peripheral may not be included in standard firmware releases. If needed, use the `custom firmware server <https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__ to  create a firmware that does."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:16
#: 5192115714ae4a898b05f9fb15a2d1ce
msgid "Where To Buy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:18
#: 3223ce6176d546039f23462bae021d0d
